      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Elektrik yang\u0131n\u0131 (C) - CO2 veya kuru kimyevi toz ile s\xF6nd\xFCr.
    Su kullanma. \n\nKat\u0131 madde yang\u0131n\u0131 (A) \u2013 (ka\u011F\u0131t,
    ah\u015Fap, kuma\u015F)Su veya k\xF6p\xFCk ile s\xF6nd\xFCr.\n\nS\u0131v\u0131
    yan\u0131c\u0131 (B) \u2013 (benzin, tiner, alkol) K\xF6p\xFCk veya kuru kimyevi
    toz ile s\xF6nd\xFCr.Su kullanma, alev yay\u0131l\u0131r.\n\nYa\u011F yang\u0131n\u0131
    (F) \u2013 (k\u0131zartma ya\u011F\u0131) Kuru kimyevi toz ile s\xF6nd\xFCr.
    Su kullanma, s\u0131\xE7rar.\n\nLPG / Do\u011Falgaz - Gaz\u0131 kes \u2192 kuru
    kimyevi toz ile s\xF6nd\xFCr.K\u0131v\u0131lc\u0131m kaynaklar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.\n\nMetal
    yang\u0131n\u0131 (D) \u2013 (magnezyum vb.) Metal tozu s\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCc\xFC
    ile s\xF6nd\xFCr. Su kullanma."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
